|                                                                             |
|                 2        2   3     2   4           2    3     3   5     2   |
|o4 = ({1, y, x, y , x*y, x , y , x*y , y }, ideal (x y, x , x*y , y ), {x y -|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         2    3   3       2     3     3    4      2    3   5     4    3      |
|     2x*y  + y , x  - 3x*y  + 2y , x*y  - y  - x*y  + y , y  - 2y  + y })    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : monomialIdeal G == inG                                                  |
